    "introHtml": "<p>A container for a group of <code>&lt;web-ui-checkbox></code>: it collapses the members' selected state into a <code>string[]</code>, dispatches <code>input</code> / <code>change</code> uniformly when it changes, and handles group-level disabling and required validation. As an attribute the value is a comma-separated string (<code>value=\"apple,cherry\"</code>), while the JS side always reads an array.</p>",
