        "id": "group-level-disabled-and-required",
        "title": "Group-level disabled and required",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p><code>disabled</code> turns off interaction for the whole group, and that disabled state is pushed down to the members; <code>required</code> makes native form validation block submission while the group is empty.</p>",
