        "id": "without-binding-open",
        "title": "Without binding open",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p>The component toggles <code>open</code> on its own, so it works with no binding at all: just provide the default slot and the <code>content</code> slot. The second one writes <code>open</code> statically, meaning it starts expanded—when it is already <code>open</code> at mount it lands directly in the expanded resting state and plays no enter animation. A static value only applies once at mount; afterwards the component keeps toggling the property itself and the page plays no part in it.</p>",
