        "id": "headless",
        "title": "Headless",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p><code>headless</code> keeps only the overlay infrastructure—backdrop, enter/exit animations, scroll lock, and native <code>&lt;dialog></code> semantics; the built-in chrome bar, content area, and footer are not rendered at all, and the default slot lands directly in the scrolling layer inside the card.</p>\n<p>With no built-in heading to associate automatically, <code>aria-dialog-label</code> must be provided by the page, and the card appearance and close button are fully self-drawn as well.</p>",
