        "id": "drag-to-close",
        "title": "Drag to close",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p>With <code>draggable</code> enabled, a gray pill-shaped drag bar appears on the inner edge of the drawer. Drag past half of its own size toward the closing direction, or fling it quickly and release, to close; below the threshold it springs back. The direction adapts to <code>placement</code>.</p>",
