    "component": "dropdown-divider",
    "tag": "web-ui-dropdown-divider",
    "introHtml": "<p>A divider inside a menu, used to separate groups of menu items.</p>\n<p>It has no props, events, or slots and does not take part in keyboard navigation—the menu only stops focus on <code>&lt;web-ui-dropdown-item></code>, and the divider itself only declares <code>role=\"separator\"</code>.</p>\n<p>It appears among the children of <code>&lt;web-ui-dropdown></code> / <code>&lt;web-ui-context-menu></code>.</p>",
