        "html": "<p>Menu items: <code>web-ui-dropdown-item</code>, <code>web-ui-dropdown-divider</code>, <code>web-ui-dropdown-header</code>. A submenu is enabled on <code>web-ui-dropdown-item</code> through the <code>submenu</code> attribute. Full keyboard navigation is supported.</p>"
