        "id": "controlled-open-state",
        "title": "Controlled open state",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p><code>open</code> is held by the page: an external button changes it directly, while the trigger, Escape, and outside clicks write back through <code>open-change</code>; clicking a menu item does not close automatically, so the code writes back in the item's native click.</p>",
