        "id": "controlled-value-and-commit",
        "title": "Controlled value and commit",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p><code>value</code> is the current value and also the form-submitted value; <code>input</code> comes from the native input of the edit layer, and <code>change</code> is dispatched once at a commit point—Enter or blur. To have the page own the value, handle <code>change</code> and write it back.</p>",
