        "id": "size-and-color",
        "title": "Size and color",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p>There is no <code>size</code> property: the graphic's edge length, the two font sizes, the colors, and the whitespace are four independent groups of variables. To scale the whole empty state, write them together—enlarging only the graphic leaves whitespace that does not match the type.</p>",
