        "title": "Spin",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p><code>spin</code> puts an infinite rotation on the <code>&lt;svg></code>, with the period taken from <code>--wui-duration-spin</code> (<code>600ms</code>). Under the <code>motion=\"reduced\"</code> theme or a system reduce preference, the token slows to <code>1600ms</code> instead of stopping: a stopped loading indicator reads as a frozen interface.</p>",
