        "id": "combined-with-button",
        "title": "Combined with button",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p>button's <code>prefix</code> / <code>suffix</code> slots hold icons; the icon and the label sit on the same flex line and share the label's text color. An icon-only button turns on <code>icon</code> and writes an <code>aria-label</code>: the icon is <code>aria-hidden</code> itself, so when the button has no other visible content it is the only clue.</p>",
