    "component": "input-number",
    "tag": "web-ui-input-number",
    "introHtml": "<p>Numeric input with a step button on each side, supporting <code>min</code> / <code>max</code> / <code>step</code> / <code>precision</code>; out-of-range and invalid input converge back to a valid value at the commit point.</p>",
