        "id": "css-variables",
        "title": "CSS variables",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p>The width comes from <code>--wui-input-width</code> (the same token as <code>&lt;web-ui-input></code>), and <code>input-number</code> has no <code>full</code> of its own; however narrow it gets, <code>--wui-control-size</code> still holds a minimum width.</p>",
