        "title": "Long strings without spaces and grapheme clusters",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p>The first line is 120 <code>a</code> characters with no spaces: no wrapping, and it is cut to exactly what the measured width can hold.</p>\n<p>The second line consists entirely of ZWJ sequences (👩‍💻 = <code>U+1F469 U+200D U+1F4BB</code>) and \"base character + variation selector\" pairs (⚠️ = <code>U+26A0 U+FE0F</code>); wherever the cut lands, the whole cluster should be preserved, with no half emoji or stray joiner.</p>\n<p>Both strings are written as escapes: <code>U+200D</code> and <code>U+FE0F</code> are zero-width, so a literal copy would be unreadable.</p>",
