        "id": "individual-disabling",
        "title": "Individual disabling",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p><code>disabled</code> on a trigger disables only that item: it stays in the track but cannot be selected, and keyboard navigation skips it. On <code>&lt;web-ui-segmented></code> it disables every trigger.</p>",
