        "id": "stroked-geometry",
        "title": "Stroked geometry",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p>It collects the geometry elements matched by the selector <code>path, rect, circle, line, polyline, polygon, ellipse</code>; within one playback they all start and advance in parallel—the component offers no entry point for delays or staggering, so a one-by-one effect requires splitting into multiple instances.</p>\n<p>A closed <code>path</code> ending with <code>Z</code> is temporarily given a short extra segment during playback so that the closing stroke is really drawn, and its original <code>d</code> is restored afterwards.</p>",
