    "tag": "web-ui-switch",
    "introHtml": "<p>Switch, declaring <code>role=\"switch\"</code> and <code>aria-checked</code>; a click toggles it immediately, and holding the track to drag horizontally or flicking it also sets the value, with both Space and Enter toggling from the keyboard.</p>\n<p>Text children of the default slot become the visible label and the default accessible name; <code>aria-label</code> or <code>aria-labelledby</code> can also be set on the host.</p>",
