    "component": "toast",
    "tag": "web-ui-toast",
    "introHtml": "<p>Imperative toast: call <code>toast()</code> to create one and get its id, then <code>toast.close(id)</code> to close it; calling again with the same <code>id</code> updates that toast instead of creating a new one. The tables below list the options of <code>toast()</code>, the imperative entry points, and the attributes, events, and methods of the <code>&lt;web-ui-toast></code> element itself.</p>",
